<title>UK: Argentina's Edenor sets $120 mln five-yr Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Edenor sets $120 mln five-yr Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Eurobond was announced by joint lead managers Citibank International, J.P. Morgan Securities and Banco Rio de la Plata.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EMPRESA DISTRIBUIDORA NORTE SA</p>
<p> AMT    $120 MLN	COUPON     9.75	MATURITY    04.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.69     PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  80 BP     REOFFER    99.69     SPREAD	+390 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX/BA    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    30 BP     SELL CONC   50 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND W/I 5-YR U.S. TREASURY  NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
